#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:154
msgid ""
"Rework color-tracking code to pass color thresholds to ``find_blobs()`` / "
"``find_markers()`` and iterate the flat blob-tuple list (:ref:`the "
"find_blobs rewrite <v1_4_0_findblobs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Bearbeta om färgspårningskod så att den skickar färgtröskelvärden till "
"``find_blobs()`` / ``find_markers()`` och itererar den platta blob-"
"tupellistan (\\ :ref:`omskrivningen av find_blobs <v1_4_0_findblobs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:157
msgid ""
"Read centroid / orientation / pixel data from the blob tuples instead of the"
" removed standalone methods (:ref:`the removed image methods "
"<v1_4_0_removed>`)."
msgstr ""
"Läs data för centroid / orientering / pixel från blob-tuplerna istället för "
"de borttagna fristående metoderna (\\ :ref:`de borttagna bildmetoderna "
"<v1_4_0_removed>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:160
msgid ""
"Rename ``subimg`` → ``copy``, ``blit`` → ``replace``, fix ``blend()`` calls,"
" and replace ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (:ref:`the imlib renames "
"<v1_4_0_imlibrename>`)."
msgstr ""
"Döp om ``subimg`` → ``copy``\\ , ``blit`` → ``replace``\\ , rätta "
"``blend()``\\ -anrop och ersätt ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (\\ "
":ref:`imlib-omdöpningarna <v1_4_0_imlibrename>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:163
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (:ref:`the find_eye rename "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`) and ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (:ref:`the compress"
" rename <v1_4_0_compress>`)."
msgstr ""
"Döp om ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (\\ :ref:`omdöpningen av find_eye "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`\\ ) och ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (\\ "
":ref:`omdöpningen av compress <v1_4_0_compress>`\\ )."

